===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*m(y)ewh₁-}}
From {{m|en|moving picture|moving (picture)}} {{suffix|en||ie}}. Attested since at least 1912 (if not 1908),<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref> originally in American English.

