===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chiefly|North America|AU|NZ}} A recorded sequence of images displayed on a [[screen#Noun|screen]] at a rate sufficiently fast to create the appearance of motion; a [[film#Noun|film]]; a [[video]].
#: {{syn|en|flick|motion picture|moving picture|moving-picture show|photoplay|picture show|picture|qq1=slang|qq3=dated|qq4=dated|qq5=dated|qq6=dated|qq7=dated, India}}
# A [[professionally]] made [[motion picture]] of a [[substantive]] [[narrative]] [[work]], ''typically'' around 1 to 3 hours long, ''typically'' intended for [[cinema]], [[art]], [[entertainment]], and a [[widespread]] [[audience]]; a [[feature film]], [[theatrical film]].
#: {{ux|en|My favorite actor is starring in the new '''movie'''.}}
# {{lb|en|usually|in the plural|chiefly|North America|AU|NZ}} A [[cinema#Noun|cinema]]; a [[movie theatre#Noun|movie theatre]].
#: {{ux|en|Let's go to the '''movies'''.}}
